  "message": "I’m sorry to hear about the delay—that’s frustrating. I can look into your most recent reservation and explain what happened. To get started, please provide your user ID. If you remember, sharing the approximate travel date and route (origin and destination) will also help me pinpoint the correct reservation quickly. Also, are you looking to make any changes or cancellations to any upcoming flights as a result of this delay, or would you like me to just investigate and document what happened?"
}

